1
00:01:06,035 --> 00:01:08,913
I would’ve understood, Pops,
if she’d said it wasn’t possible.

2
00:01:10,183 --> 00:01:12,268
But I wish she'd told me...

3
00:01:12,841 --> 00:01:14,176
why it wasn't possible.

4
00:01:14,176 --> 00:01:15,761
I didn't even get to explain to Estong

5
00:01:15,761 --> 00:01:19,056
the real reason why I reacted that way.

6
00:01:19,271 --> 00:01:21,241
She wants you to focus on yourself,

7
00:01:21,266 --> 00:01:24,478
because she feels that you
haven't really gotten over your ex.

8
00:01:24,478 --> 00:01:26,396
All I know is, from what
I read in Ysa’s diary...

9
00:01:26,813 --> 00:01:29,733
is that you're still unsure
about what you want in life!

10
00:01:30,108 --> 00:01:32,486
If that's all we can be,
then alright. We'll just be friends.

11
00:01:32,486 --> 00:01:34,905
That way, you won't have
to avoid me anymore.

12
00:01:34,988 --> 00:01:38,425
Better to be friends
than enemies, right, son?

13
00:01:38,450 --> 00:01:39,467
Fair enough.

14
00:01:40,369 --> 00:01:41,787
It's world peace for the both of you.

15
00:01:41,958 --> 00:01:43,501
I'm sorry, Estong.

16
00:01:43,914 --> 00:01:46,625
I can see the efforts you're making.

17
00:01:46,875 --> 00:01:50,629
But I'm not the right personality
to make the decision for all of us.

18
00:01:51,213 --> 00:01:52,178
Ysa...

19
00:01:52,562 --> 00:01:53,689
I really love you.

20
00:01:55,717 --> 00:01:56,301
Ysa?

21
00:01:56,301 --> 00:01:58,762
I'm not Ysa! My name is Belle!

22
00:01:59,054 --> 00:02:01,640
Ysa is just one of the personalities.

23
00:02:01,890 --> 00:02:04,362
It's Belle. She's the real Ysabelle.

24
00:03:18,383 --> 00:03:19,176
Ysa?

25
00:03:19,718 --> 00:03:21,136
She's just one of the personalities?

26
00:03:22,763 --> 00:03:23,968
How did that happen?

27
00:03:24,181 --> 00:03:25,515
And— and how...

28
00:03:25,631 --> 00:03:26,812
How would it be Belle?

29
00:03:27,271 --> 00:03:28,285
I mean...

30
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:30,124
I didn’t even meet Belle until now.

31
00:03:30,921 --> 00:03:31,755
Belle...

32
00:03:32,189 --> 00:03:34,316
she's the first of them all.

33
00:03:34,316 --> 00:03:35,442
She is the original.

34
00:03:38,418 --> 00:03:39,389
Original?

35
00:03:39,821 --> 00:03:40,906
She's Ysabelle.

36
00:03:41,406 --> 00:03:44,760
You do know why her other personalities
come out, right?

37
00:03:44,785 --> 00:03:47,954
Because she couldn’t handle
the trauma she went through.

38
00:03:48,288 --> 00:03:49,790
A few days before she met you,

39
00:03:49,790 --> 00:03:52,616
she experienced another one.

40
00:03:58,882 --> 00:04:00,300
Do you like Estong?

41
00:04:01,610 --> 00:04:02,903
You have to let it go.

42
00:04:02,928 --> 00:04:06,598
We're only trying to avoid
what happened to you before.

43
00:04:06,807 --> 00:04:07,824
You mean for Belle?

44
00:04:09,226 --> 00:04:12,062
[parents screaming and fighting]

45
00:04:16,233 --> 00:04:17,926
That if she gets triggered,

46
00:04:22,739 --> 00:04:24,825
she might hurt herself again...

47
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:27,620
and us.

48
00:04:34,017 --> 00:04:35,560
The Belle we know

49
00:04:35,585 --> 00:04:37,019
retreats into her own world,

50
00:04:37,337 --> 00:04:38,797
makes her own decisions,

51
00:04:39,025 --> 00:04:41,027
and is very blunt.

52
00:04:54,437 --> 00:04:55,981
And when she’s quiet,

53
00:04:56,356 --> 00:04:59,785
you never know what’s
going through her mind.

54
00:05:04,072 --> 00:05:05,115
- Belle!
- Belle, don't!

55
00:05:05,115 --> 00:05:06,216
- Sweetheart.
- Belle, don't.

56
00:05:06,365 --> 00:05:07,469
Belle, dear.

57
00:05:07,494 --> 00:05:09,245
- Sweetheart.
- Belle, don't.

58
00:05:09,536 --> 00:05:10,371
Sweetheart...

59
00:05:11,204 --> 00:05:12,168
Dear, no!

60
00:05:22,642 --> 00:05:23,717
Did you eat already?

61
00:05:23,717 --> 00:05:25,277
One day,

62
00:05:25,302 --> 00:05:26,553
- she met a guy.
- I'm done eating.

63
00:05:27,524 --> 00:05:29,197
His name is Lorenz.

64
00:05:30,635 --> 00:05:32,212
They talked constantly.

65
00:05:32,237 --> 00:05:33,489
Almost everyday.

66
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:39,111
That was the first time
we saw her so happy.

67
00:05:40,368 --> 00:05:43,121
We insisted that she meet
Lorenz in person,

68
00:05:43,347 --> 00:05:46,306
so things could feel more
normal for her.

69
00:05:48,116 --> 00:05:51,408
But after they met...

70
00:06:07,469 --> 00:06:08,090
Dear,

71
00:06:08,115 --> 00:06:09,130
are you okay?

72
00:06:11,431 --> 00:06:13,183
Belle said

73
00:06:13,631 --> 00:06:16,133
Lorenz was scared of her, so he left.

74
00:06:18,563 --> 00:06:20,482
They never spoke to each other again.

75
00:06:23,318 --> 00:06:26,446
Lorenz never reached out to her again.

76
00:06:27,155 --> 00:06:28,865
Belle was hurt.

77
00:06:29,366 --> 00:06:32,452
So she wanted to
forget she'd ever met him.

78
00:06:37,249 --> 00:06:39,542
Belle isolated herself in
her room for a long time,

79
00:06:39,918 --> 00:06:41,628
barely ever coming out.

80
00:06:42,003 --> 00:06:44,464
Then one day, we were surprised.

81
00:06:44,464 --> 00:06:45,090
Dear?

82
00:06:46,299 --> 00:06:47,509
How are you feeling?

83
00:06:51,179 --> 00:06:53,431
Belle is just resting, Nanang Barbs.

84
00:06:53,807 --> 00:06:55,433
I'll be with you for now.

85
00:07:01,856 --> 00:07:02,649
Um...

86
00:07:02,649 --> 00:07:03,608
Who are you?

87
00:07:04,025 --> 00:07:05,902
We haven’t met you before.

88
00:07:07,705 --> 00:07:08,980
I'm Ysa.

89
00:07:09,403 --> 00:07:10,816
It's okay, don't worry.

90
00:07:14,769 --> 00:07:17,011
When Belle was last traumatized,

91
00:07:17,303 --> 00:07:19,878
that’s when Ysa first emerged.

92
00:07:28,675 --> 00:07:29,691
How...

93
00:07:30,144 --> 00:07:31,354
How is Belle the original?

94
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:35,972
I don't understand.

95
00:07:37,767 --> 00:07:38,643
Tita Barbs...

96
00:07:39,978 --> 00:07:43,144
Estong, they're both completely different.

97
00:07:48,153 --> 00:07:50,088
I still want to get to know...

98
00:07:50,276 --> 00:07:51,214
Belle.

99
00:07:52,575 --> 00:07:54,202
You don't understand.

100
00:07:54,534 --> 00:07:57,519
Belle doesn't like her other personalities.

101
00:07:58,079 --> 00:08:00,707
So whatever’s going on
between you and Ysabelle,

102
00:08:00,732 --> 00:08:02,386
you need to stop.

103
00:08:02,917 --> 00:08:04,919
I'm just afraid that

104
00:08:05,253 --> 00:08:08,356
when she has to deal
with new emotions,

105
00:08:08,381 --> 00:08:10,275
she might become even more confused.

106
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:12,886
We don’t know how this will affect her.

107
00:08:13,053 --> 00:08:16,181
Another personality might emerge,

108
00:08:17,032 --> 00:08:19,034
or Ysa might disappear instead.

109
00:08:32,175 --> 00:08:34,035
I wonder how you're doing, Lorenz.

110
00:08:48,296 --> 00:08:49,613
So...

111
00:08:50,882 --> 00:08:53,259
You really like strange stories?

112
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:55,199
Mhm!

113
00:08:55,678 --> 00:08:57,004
It's part of my job.

114
00:08:58,136 --> 00:08:59,512
I'm a Junior Story Producer.

115
00:09:00,475 --> 00:09:01,367
But,

116
00:09:01,485 --> 00:09:03,571
can we not talk about work for now?

117
00:09:05,271 --> 00:09:06,082
Uh...

118
00:09:06,272 --> 00:09:07,040
I’m curious.

119
00:09:07,065 --> 00:09:08,358
You’ve been painting
for a long time, right?

120
00:09:10,672 --> 00:09:12,007
I don’t really have any other hobbies.

121
00:09:13,386 --> 00:09:14,346
That's actually great.

122
00:09:14,371 --> 00:09:15,872
Your paintings are beautiful.

123
00:09:16,449 --> 00:09:17,509
But...

124
00:09:17,534 --> 00:09:19,363
have you ever had a solo exhibit?

125
00:09:20,533 --> 00:09:21,742
That's my dream.

126
00:09:22,247 --> 00:09:23,957
That's why I'll put
together a collection first.

127
00:09:25,125 --> 00:09:26,084
You can do it.

128
00:09:26,109 --> 00:09:27,209
I know you can.

129
00:09:28,296 --> 00:09:29,301
Thank you.

130
00:09:29,797 --> 00:09:30,957
I hope...

131
00:09:31,098 --> 00:09:33,238
more people will get to see your paintings.

132
00:09:34,862 --> 00:09:36,019
And I hope...

133
00:09:36,551 --> 00:09:38,178
your dream of having an exhibit comes true.

134
00:09:40,191 --> 00:09:41,525
Just make sure you'll come, okay?

135
00:09:41,890 --> 00:09:42,933
Of course.

136
00:09:43,309 --> 00:09:44,472
That's a promise.

137
00:09:49,314 --> 00:09:50,262
Uh...

138
00:09:51,901 --> 00:09:52,847
Belle.

139
00:09:54,445 --> 00:09:55,535
Is it okay if...

140
00:09:57,724 --> 00:09:58,809
I hold your hand?

141
00:10:11,629 --> 00:10:13,550
You're more beautiful in person, Belle.

142
00:10:14,924 --> 00:10:16,839
You don’t seem hard to love.

143
00:10:21,930 --> 00:10:24,641
Happy Birthday to you!

144
00:10:24,809 --> 00:10:27,145
Happy Birthday to you!

145
00:10:29,721 --> 00:10:30,680
Wow!

146
00:10:30,705 --> 00:10:31,998
Cake!

147
00:10:32,665 --> 00:10:35,626
Wow! Yeye wants cake!

148
00:10:35,866 --> 00:10:36,909
Happy Birthday!

149
00:10:38,448 --> 00:10:39,824
Yay!

150
00:10:40,241 --> 00:10:42,118
Happy Birthday!

151
00:10:42,952 --> 00:10:44,120
- Cake! You want cake?
- Belle. Belle, wait!

152
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,788
Cake! Cake!

153
00:10:45,788 --> 00:10:48,124
- Belle, wait. Are you okay?
- Happy Birthday!

154
00:10:48,124 --> 00:10:49,503
Why did you do that?!

155
00:10:50,251 --> 00:10:51,961
Yeye wants cake!

156
00:10:52,295 --> 00:10:54,964
Happy Birthday!

157
00:10:58,218 --> 00:10:59,928
OMG! What's this?!

158
00:10:59,928 --> 00:11:03,348
This is so sticky like ew! It's so gross!

159
00:11:03,348 --> 00:11:04,807
Yuck!

160
00:11:06,723 --> 00:11:07,515
Who are you?

161
00:11:07,540 --> 00:11:08,536
What?

162
00:11:08,561 --> 00:11:10,063
What am I doing here?

163
00:11:10,605 --> 00:11:12,565
Are you my date?

164
00:11:17,592 --> 00:11:18,468
Uh, miss?

165
00:11:18,821 --> 00:11:19,776
Miss?

166
00:11:21,324 --> 00:11:22,300
Excuse me.

167
00:11:23,618 --> 00:11:25,286
- Were you the one who scared the kid?
- What?!

168
00:11:25,286 --> 00:11:27,121
Let go of me! Why do you
keep on grabbing me?!

169
00:11:27,664 --> 00:11:29,707
What’s your problem?!
You wanna fight?!

170
00:11:29,707 --> 00:11:30,750
- What?!
- Calm down.

171
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:32,685
- What is happening to you, Miss?
- I said let go of me!

172
00:11:32,710 --> 00:11:34,295
- What's going on with you?
- You keep on grabbing me!

173
00:11:40,485 --> 00:11:44,530
Yeye scared of Kuya Guard!

174
00:11:44,555 --> 00:11:46,391
I'm scared!

175
00:11:48,977 --> 00:11:50,561
Guard, she's crazy.
Get her out of here!

176
00:11:51,062 --> 00:11:52,272
- That's right.
- Yeah!

177
00:11:52,438 --> 00:11:55,041
Oh, why are you guys
looking at me like that?

178
00:11:55,066 --> 00:11:56,317
- Oh, don't look at me.
- Get her out of here, guard!

179
00:11:56,317 --> 00:11:58,528
- Oh, I don't look so nice!
- She needs to leave.

180
00:11:59,153 --> 00:12:00,613
Guard, let her out!

181
00:12:00,738 --> 00:12:02,448
- Miss, you need to stop.
- She seems crazy.

182
00:12:02,657 --> 00:12:03,667
I don't wanna be here.

183
00:12:04,325 --> 00:12:05,827
I don't wanna be here.
I want to go home.

184
00:12:06,953 --> 00:12:07,370
Miss.

185
00:12:07,370 --> 00:12:08,621
My dears,

186
00:12:08,621 --> 00:12:10,206
stop it.

187
00:12:10,415 --> 00:12:12,792
Please, think of Belle.

188
00:12:13,334 --> 00:12:15,169
My head hurts.

189
00:12:17,588 --> 00:12:18,612
What's your problem?!

190
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,465
What?!

191
00:12:19,465 --> 00:12:20,733
What are you looking at?!

192
00:12:20,758 --> 00:12:22,635
What's your problem?
Why are you staring at me, huh?!

193
00:12:22,635 --> 00:12:24,679
- Don't mess with me!
- Belle! Belle, stop it!

194
00:12:24,679 --> 00:12:26,014
- Miss, miss, stop—
- Leave me alone!

195
00:12:26,014 --> 00:12:27,598
- Belle! Belle! Belle!
- Knock it off!

196
00:12:27,598 --> 00:12:29,434
- Belle, Belle.
- I said let go of me!

197
00:12:29,434 --> 00:12:30,059
Belle!

198
00:12:30,059 --> 00:12:32,228
Didn't I tell you to let go of me?!

199
00:12:32,709 --> 00:12:34,335
You keep on grabbing me!

200
00:12:34,712 --> 00:12:36,472
Base, we've got a crazy person here.

201
00:12:36,859 --> 00:12:38,528
We need to call the police right away.

202
00:12:38,642 --> 00:12:40,104
Just let me be, please!

203
00:12:40,570 --> 00:12:42,530
Stop it now. Let me be!

204
00:12:42,530 --> 00:12:44,157
Not now! Not here, not here!

205
00:12:44,289 --> 00:12:46,237
Leave me alone. Leave me alone.

206
00:12:46,868 --> 00:12:50,121
- Belle! Belle! Belle!
- My head hurts so much!

207
00:12:50,121 --> 00:12:50,886
Belle!

208
00:12:51,581 --> 00:12:52,565
Calm down.

209
00:12:53,124 --> 00:12:54,120
Calm down, please.

210
00:12:54,667 --> 00:12:55,293
Calm down.

211
00:12:55,293 --> 00:12:58,588
He’s been there for a while now.
He hasn’t done anything.

212
00:13:00,563 --> 00:13:02,773
Miss, what are you doing?!
You’re causing trouble.

213
00:13:05,678 --> 00:13:07,972
- Get out of here!
- Guard!

214
00:13:12,268 --> 00:13:13,478
Sir!

215
00:13:13,686 --> 00:13:15,146
Don’t leave your companion behind.

216
00:13:32,678 --> 00:13:34,347
But I want to see you again.

217
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,729
You promised you'd come to my exhibit.

218
00:13:47,011 --> 00:13:48,596
Why’s that, Kuya? Huh?

219
00:13:48,745 --> 00:13:50,139
Why's that? I don't understand.

220
00:13:50,347 --> 00:13:52,683
Why did they only tell
you about Ate Belle now?

221
00:13:52,822 --> 00:13:53,949
And Adel's just...

222
00:13:54,977 --> 00:13:55,770
I'm losing it, Kuya.

223
00:13:55,770 --> 00:13:56,562
Okay, that's enough—

224
00:13:56,562 --> 00:13:58,481
And Adel's keeping secrets from me.

225
00:13:58,689 --> 00:14:00,316
- Ugh, seriously!
- Shhh.

226
00:14:00,900 --> 00:14:02,081
Sorry, sorry.

227
00:14:02,527 --> 00:14:04,695
- Okay, enough. That's enough.
- I can't remove this.

228
00:14:04,695 --> 00:14:06,072
- Enough!
- No, no, Popsy.

229
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:06,989
It's not right!

230
00:14:07,407 --> 00:14:08,616
It's like they...they....

231
00:14:08,616 --> 00:14:09,826
it's like they lied to us!

232
00:14:10,034 --> 00:14:10,493
Right?

233
00:14:10,493 --> 00:14:11,536
Oh, come on!

234
00:14:11,536 --> 00:14:13,413
- Why?!
- Okay, stop!

235
00:14:13,413 --> 00:14:15,377
You're being so
dramatic. It's not helping.

236
00:14:15,401 --> 00:14:17,083
I'm shaking.
I'm shaking, Pops.

237
00:14:17,083 --> 00:14:18,083
I'm serious.

238
00:14:19,316 --> 00:14:20,232
It's wet!

239
00:14:21,379 --> 00:14:22,989
Enough, enough, enough!

240
00:14:23,506 --> 00:14:24,632
You know, Estong...

241
00:14:25,535 --> 00:14:27,662
Ysa’s parents are right.

242
00:14:28,056 --> 00:14:30,225
They're just protecting their daughter.

243
00:14:30,486 --> 00:14:32,363
So if I were you...

244
00:14:33,676 --> 00:14:34,886
if you can...

245
00:14:36,394 --> 00:14:38,104
just stay away from Ysa.

246
00:14:41,107 --> 00:14:41,899
Pops, I thought,

247
00:14:41,899 --> 00:14:43,901
"As long as there's breath in us,
there's still some fight in us."

248
00:14:44,986 --> 00:14:46,070
I won’t give up on her.

249
00:14:46,904 --> 00:14:47,530
See?

250
00:14:47,905 --> 00:14:50,700
See, Kuya? It’s also your
fault you keep getting hurt.

251
00:14:52,427 --> 00:14:53,804
I believe that...

252
00:14:54,370 --> 00:14:55,496
if I became close with Ysa,

253
00:14:55,496 --> 00:14:56,975
I can do the same with Belle.

254
00:14:58,875 --> 00:15:01,210
But they're not the same, okay?

255
00:15:02,003 --> 00:15:04,172
They're both different personalities.

256
00:15:05,214 --> 00:15:07,592
Their Nanang even said that...

257
00:15:08,092 --> 00:15:09,760
Belle still isn’t okay.

258
00:15:09,927 --> 00:15:12,472
What, do you want to confuse Ysa again?

259
00:15:22,273 --> 00:15:23,273
Son...

260
00:15:24,942 --> 00:15:27,570
You also need to protect yourself.

261
00:15:28,731 --> 00:15:29,899
And your heart too.

262
00:15:42,502 --> 00:15:43,813
Uh, hide that.

263
00:15:43,838 --> 00:15:44,880
Hide all of it.

264
00:15:44,921 --> 00:15:46,130
She can’t see that

265
00:15:46,130 --> 00:15:48,274
and find out that her life has changed,

266
00:15:48,299 --> 00:15:49,066
okay?

267
00:15:49,091 --> 00:15:50,318
Because of Ysa,

268
00:15:50,343 --> 00:15:51,527
the exhibit,

269
00:15:51,552 --> 00:15:52,345
Estong...

270
00:15:52,345 --> 00:15:53,414
Oh, all of it!

271
00:15:54,430 --> 00:15:55,723
Doc, Ate Belle doesn’t know

272
00:15:55,723 --> 00:15:57,350
she’s been gone this long?

273
00:15:58,269 --> 00:15:59,412
Obviously.

274
00:15:59,437 --> 00:16:02,148
Let’s just say she’s been hibernating in
her inner world.

275
00:16:02,230 --> 00:16:04,080
But we’ll tell her

276
00:16:04,105 --> 00:16:05,231
if she wants to know.

277
00:16:05,375 --> 00:16:06,460
Just at the right time.

278
00:16:06,817 --> 00:16:07,877
Uh, Doc,

279
00:16:07,902 --> 00:16:09,904
do you think she’s recovering,

280
00:16:09,904 --> 00:16:10,988
or is she still the same?

281
00:16:11,989 --> 00:16:13,257
I can’t say for sure.

282
00:16:13,484 --> 00:16:15,820
I need to assess her
first before we can know.

283
00:16:16,536 --> 00:16:17,828
But what’s important now is that

284
00:16:17,828 --> 00:16:20,831
we have to be very careful with her,

285
00:16:20,831 --> 00:16:23,180
because she could snap at any moment.

286
00:16:23,388 --> 00:16:24,848
The best thing we can really do...

287
00:16:25,503 --> 00:16:28,814
is to shower her with
love and understanding.

288
00:16:28,940 --> 00:16:30,317
That's what will help her.

289
00:16:30,453 --> 00:16:31,954
- That’s what we should do.
- Exactly.

290
00:16:33,553 --> 00:16:34,461
It's Belle.

291
00:16:39,559 --> 00:16:40,430
Huh.

292
00:16:41,269 --> 00:16:42,766
Why did you all suddenly go quiet?

293
00:16:44,188 --> 00:16:45,623
Were you talking about me?

294
00:16:45,648 --> 00:16:47,108
- No.
- No. Of course, not.

295
00:16:47,108 --> 00:16:49,443
- No. No, sweetheart.
- No, Ate Belle, I promise. we weren’t.

296
00:16:49,443 --> 00:16:50,695
- We weren't, right?
- No, we really weren't talking about you.

297
00:16:50,695 --> 00:16:52,113
Why are you all trying hard to pretend?

298
00:16:52,113 --> 00:16:54,235
I wouldn't be mad if you guys were.

299
00:16:59,213 --> 00:17:00,290
What's that?

300
00:17:01,497 --> 00:17:02,915
Oh, it's nothing.

301
00:17:02,915 --> 00:17:04,542
Just put it down here.

302
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:09,916
Um, sweetheart?

303
00:17:11,530 --> 00:17:12,990
How are you feeling?

304
00:17:14,019 --> 00:17:15,143
I'm okay.

305
00:17:15,168 --> 00:17:16,461
Hello, Belle!

306
00:17:16,804 --> 00:17:18,531
You look good this morning. Right?

307
00:17:18,889 --> 00:17:20,558
Right. How are you, dear?

308
00:17:20,736 --> 00:17:22,154
You've been gone for quite some time.

309
00:17:22,179 --> 00:17:23,388
Uh, Erna, she was just asleep.

310
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:24,769
She had a good night's sleep.

311
00:17:25,807 --> 00:17:27,100
Uh, sweetheart, are you...

312
00:17:27,231 --> 00:17:28,250
are you going somewhere?

313
00:17:29,151 --> 00:17:31,203
I just need to finish my painting.

314
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:33,516
It seems like one is
missing. Have you seen it?

315
00:17:34,739 --> 00:17:35,673
Uh...

316
00:17:35,698 --> 00:17:36,949
Oh, maybe it just got misplaced...

317
00:17:36,949 --> 00:17:39,577
Uh... don’t worry. I’ll look for it.

318
00:17:39,744 --> 00:17:40,680
No, it's okay.

319
00:17:40,911 --> 00:17:42,413
I'll just paint a new one.

320
00:17:42,413 --> 00:17:44,081
I also need to talk to Ms. Amara.

321
00:17:44,081 --> 00:17:45,516
She might be getting upset.

322
00:17:45,587 --> 00:17:47,391
I wasn’t able to submit my work on time.

323
00:17:47,924 --> 00:17:48,967
It’s so weird.

324
00:17:48,992 --> 00:17:50,463
It feels like I’ve been asleep for so long.

325
00:17:50,463 --> 00:17:51,563
How many days was it?

326
00:17:51,714 --> 00:17:52,173
Oh.

327
00:17:52,423 --> 00:17:52,965
Belle...

328
00:17:52,965 --> 00:17:55,426
Don’t forget to take your medication,

329
00:17:55,426 --> 00:17:57,386
and let's keep up with our
therapy sessions, okay?

330
00:17:57,970 --> 00:17:59,172
Oh, Doc, didn't see you there.

331
00:17:59,197 --> 00:18:00,110
Yeah.

332
00:18:00,598 --> 00:18:01,682
You look like you’ve gotten fat.

333
00:18:01,682 --> 00:18:03,578
Are you stressed? Are you stress eating?

334
00:18:05,185 --> 00:18:06,811
Yeah. You noticed?

335
00:18:06,861 --> 00:18:07,828
Mhm.

336
00:18:08,606 --> 00:18:09,703
I'll get going now.

337
00:18:10,005 --> 00:18:10,984
Okay, sweetheart.

338
00:18:15,571 --> 00:18:17,492
Oh, God, I hope she's going to be okay.

339
00:18:18,324 --> 00:18:20,576
I still have a tracker on Ate.

340
00:18:21,199 --> 00:18:22,158
I'll see to it.

341
00:18:22,311 --> 00:18:23,141
Okay.

342
00:18:24,163 --> 00:18:25,227
Did I get fat?

343
00:18:27,667 --> 00:18:28,594
A little bit.

344
00:18:29,685 --> 00:18:31,312
I knew it. She noticed.

345
00:18:47,853 --> 00:18:48,771
OMG.

346
00:18:50,730 --> 00:18:52,857
Ysa looks so different today.

347
00:18:53,199 --> 00:18:55,179
Looks like she's been through something.

348
00:19:02,727 --> 00:19:04,228
- Excuse me.
- Ah, yes?

349
00:19:04,286 --> 00:19:06,080
Two Americano Lattes,

350
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:08,249
one Iced Mocha.

351
00:19:08,569 --> 00:19:10,404
All large. Dine-in.

352
00:19:10,876 --> 00:19:12,186
There's an Americano Latte?

353
00:19:12,211 --> 00:19:13,337
Uh, sorry, what was that again?

354
00:19:13,504 --> 00:19:14,463
I said,

355
00:19:14,630 --> 00:19:16,132
two Cafe Lattes,

356
00:19:16,430 --> 00:19:17,557
one Iced Mocha.

357
00:19:17,591 --> 00:19:18,384
All large.

358
00:19:18,384 --> 00:19:20,594
- Dine-in
- Uh, hold on, there's a...

359
00:19:20,594 --> 00:19:21,137
There's an error in the system.

360
00:19:21,137 --> 00:19:22,113
Sorry, what was that again?

361
00:19:22,138 --> 00:19:24,242
Forget it! close down!

362
00:19:26,414 --> 00:19:27,457
Here, here. Look at this.

363
00:19:27,482 --> 00:19:29,125
I just read this online.

364
00:19:29,895 --> 00:19:32,481
- People online said it's good.
- What do they have that’s good here?

365
00:19:32,481 --> 00:19:34,483
Let's see. I'll also check their...

366
00:19:34,483 --> 00:19:36,419
- recommendations.
- Here are our best sellers.

367
00:19:36,444 --> 00:19:37,320
Let's see.

368
00:19:37,361 --> 00:19:39,321
Here we can see their reviews online.

369
00:19:39,321 --> 00:19:40,304
I'd like to order.

370
00:19:41,741 --> 00:19:42,591
Miss...

371
00:19:42,616 --> 00:19:45,077
- there's a line. We got here first.
- We were here before you.

372
00:19:45,494 --> 00:19:47,079
Why? Do you already know what you
want to order?

373
00:19:47,079 --> 00:19:48,122
Not yet, but—

374
00:19:48,122 --> 00:19:49,540
- Not yet, right? So I’ll go first.
- We were here first.

375
00:19:53,252 --> 00:19:54,109
Ysa.

376
00:19:56,192 --> 00:19:57,026
Oh, I mean Belle.

377
00:19:57,798 --> 00:19:58,789
You?

378
00:20:00,551 --> 00:20:01,422
You know me?

379
00:20:01,447 --> 00:20:03,054
You’re the one who almost kissed me, right?

380
00:20:05,931 --> 00:20:07,933
You’re also the one who slapped me hard.

381
00:20:08,934 --> 00:20:09,869
How are you?

382
00:20:09,941 --> 00:20:10,937
Who are you again?

383
00:20:11,353 --> 00:20:12,195
Estong.

384
00:20:12,521 --> 00:20:13,481
I'm Ysa's friend.

385
00:20:13,606 --> 00:20:14,738
Ysa?

386
00:20:16,025 --> 00:20:17,693
Yes, Ysa. One of the—

387
00:20:17,693 --> 00:20:18,988
Do you think I care?

388
00:20:20,889 --> 00:20:22,265
That's not why I came here.

389
00:20:26,243 --> 00:20:27,453
Why are you here now?

390
00:20:27,870 --> 00:20:29,347
This is a coffee shop, right?

391
00:20:29,497 --> 00:20:31,558
What do you think people
do at a coffee shop?

392
00:20:33,250 --> 00:20:34,215
I know.

393
00:20:34,835 --> 00:20:36,152
You're gonna order a coffee.

394
00:20:36,177 --> 00:20:38,676
Large Americano. Hot.

395
00:20:38,714 --> 00:20:39,423
Just one.

396
00:20:39,423 --> 00:20:40,299
Sugar level?

397
00:20:40,423 --> 00:20:41,633
I don't like sweet drinks.

398
00:20:47,139 --> 00:20:48,808
Oh, look, we're up.

399
00:20:48,808 --> 00:20:49,934
- Hey.
- Hi, hi!

400
00:20:50,851 --> 00:20:52,102
- Uh...
- Hi.

401
00:20:52,102 --> 00:20:53,813
What can you recommend?

402
00:20:53,813 --> 00:20:55,272
- Uh, actually, what's this?
- Oh, matcha for me

403
00:20:55,439 --> 00:20:57,066
- Matcha?
- Kuya...

404
00:20:57,733 --> 00:20:58,984
Let’s just pretend

405
00:20:58,984 --> 00:21:00,903
I didn’t see you embarrass yourself.

406
00:21:05,241 --> 00:21:06,903
She’s completely different from Ysa, bro.

407
00:21:08,548 --> 00:21:10,425
You know, Kuya, I just
thought of something.

408
00:21:10,621 --> 00:21:11,372
Why...

409
00:21:11,372 --> 00:21:13,707
Why don’t you find a way

410
00:21:13,707 --> 00:21:15,379
to bring Ate Ysa out?

411
00:21:16,252 --> 00:21:17,670
What are her triggers?

412
00:21:18,170 --> 00:21:19,059
Right?

413
00:21:22,591 --> 00:21:25,094
Spanish Latte for Ms. Ysa.

414
00:21:25,386 --> 00:21:28,389
Cold with 75 percent sugar.

415
00:21:28,389 --> 00:21:28,931
Mmm!

416
00:21:28,931 --> 00:21:31,534
It’s delicious! The flavor is just right.

417
00:21:31,684 --> 00:21:32,573
Thank you.

418
00:21:32,935 --> 00:21:34,770
- Mister? Hello? Mister?
- I know what to do.

419
00:21:34,770 --> 00:21:35,788
Hello?

420
00:21:35,813 --> 00:21:36,480
Oh.

421
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:38,816
We're going to order now. Um...

422
00:21:39,733 --> 00:21:40,734
All of this.

423
00:21:40,734 --> 00:21:42,361
- Uh, all of it?
- Yes, they look delicious. Yes.

424
00:21:42,361 --> 00:21:43,487
I'm kidding. I don't have the budget.

425
00:21:43,487 --> 00:21:45,906
- So, just a matcha and a latte.
- You can't afford them after all.

426
00:21:45,906 --> 00:21:46,532
What's your...

427
00:21:46,532 --> 00:21:47,575
what's your final order, sir?

428
00:21:47,575 --> 00:21:49,285
Uh, wait, was that your ex?

429
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:50,244
Right?

430
00:21:50,244 --> 00:21:51,787
- Were you guys a thing?
- No.

431
00:21:51,787 --> 00:21:53,104
Good thing you two broke up.

432
00:21:53,921 --> 00:21:55,006
Yeah, she's got attitude, right?

433
00:22:08,220 --> 00:22:09,776
I wonder how he's doing.

434
00:22:19,939 --> 00:22:21,149
Here's your order, ma'am.

435
00:22:30,198 --> 00:22:32,161
So all of you really like painting, huh?

436
00:22:35,963 --> 00:22:37,089
Ysa would love that.

437
00:22:37,833 --> 00:22:39,209
That’s your shared dream, right?

438
00:22:41,607 --> 00:22:42,900
You two were together last night, right?

439
00:22:43,881 --> 00:22:45,007
What’s going on between you two?

440
00:22:47,259 --> 00:22:48,206
Uh...

441
00:22:49,470 --> 00:22:50,823
Ysa and I are friends.

442
00:22:51,823 --> 00:22:53,033
Really good friends.

443
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:56,518
And your other personalities, too.

444
00:22:57,728 --> 00:22:58,812
So I hope

445
00:22:58,979 --> 00:23:00,667
we can be friends too, Belle.

446
00:23:03,251 --> 00:23:04,745
Friends? That close?

447
00:23:05,694 --> 00:23:07,988
You can do that with Ysa.

448
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:09,325
But not with me.

449
00:23:10,616 --> 00:23:11,784
And let me make one thing clear...

450
00:23:12,159 --> 00:23:14,787
just because you're
friends with my personalities,

451
00:23:15,329 --> 00:23:17,065
doesn't mean you're friends with me.

452
00:23:21,961 --> 00:23:23,337
Just leave me alone.

453
00:23:27,159 --> 00:23:29,104
And the coffee isn’t even good.

454
00:23:29,432 --> 00:23:31,596
That’s not the way I told you to make it.

455
00:23:33,305 --> 00:23:35,057
I’ll have it replaced. I’m sorry.

456
00:23:53,659 --> 00:23:54,370
Psst.

457
00:23:54,743 --> 00:23:55,456
Hey.

458
00:23:58,796 --> 00:24:01,590
So you’ve been keeping secrets from
my Kuya and me.

459
00:24:02,001 --> 00:24:02,876
And

460
00:24:03,016 --> 00:24:04,601
you’re always here because...

461
00:24:04,837 --> 00:24:06,206
you want to see me?

462
00:24:07,506 --> 00:24:08,841
- Excuse me?
- Nice one!

463
00:24:09,633 --> 00:24:11,969
I never said I wanted to see you.

464
00:24:12,511 --> 00:24:14,596
I’m here because Ate Belle is here.

465
00:24:15,556 --> 00:24:16,784
Ouch.

466
00:24:26,734 --> 00:24:27,768
Wait a minute.

467
00:24:28,152 --> 00:24:30,487
Why are you guys always watching Ate Belle?

468
00:24:30,548 --> 00:24:32,596
And you’ve even got a tracker on her.

469
00:24:32,823 --> 00:24:34,050
Is that how it is now?

470
00:24:34,366 --> 00:24:36,452
Ate’s tracker number has always been there.

471
00:24:37,119 --> 00:24:39,121
So if anything happens,

472
00:24:39,329 --> 00:24:41,123
we’ll know where to look for her.

473
00:24:41,790 --> 00:24:42,751
Uh...

474
00:24:42,958 --> 00:24:44,478
What could happen to her?

475
00:24:45,669 --> 00:24:47,390
- Hey, Kuya Estong!
- Kuya.

476
00:24:47,415 --> 00:24:48,714
I have something to tell you.

477
00:24:48,714 --> 00:24:50,267
It’s from Dr. Wanda.

478
00:24:51,425 --> 00:24:52,134
Um...

479
00:24:52,134 --> 00:24:53,969
She said we shouldn’t just tell Ate Belle

480
00:24:53,969 --> 00:24:55,763
everything that happened.

481
00:24:57,771 --> 00:24:59,009
Why are you only telling me now?

482
00:25:00,392 --> 00:25:01,101
Why?

483
00:25:01,248 --> 00:25:02,462
Did you already say something?

484
00:25:03,187 --> 00:25:04,455
I only said

485
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:06,415
I became friends with her personalities.

486
00:25:06,564 --> 00:25:08,065
Are you sure that's all you said?

487
00:25:09,985 --> 00:25:11,653
What else am I not supposed to say?

488
00:25:13,072 --> 00:25:13,947
Uh...

489
00:25:14,063 --> 00:25:17,923
Just don’t tell her what
happened last month,

490
00:25:17,993 --> 00:25:20,120
what the other personalities did,

491
00:25:20,120 --> 00:25:23,363
and... uh, especially about
you being with Ate Ysa.

492
00:25:23,388 --> 00:25:24,298
Don’t.

493
00:25:28,305 --> 00:25:29,890
What will happen if she finds out?

494
00:25:30,964 --> 00:25:35,079
If Ate Ysa wants all her
personalities to come together...

495
00:25:35,768 --> 00:25:37,228
Ate Belle doesn’t.

496
00:25:38,818 --> 00:25:40,194
She wants them gone.

497
00:25:41,222 --> 00:25:42,265
Because she feels like

498
00:25:42,499 --> 00:25:45,118
they’re stealing the life
that only belongs to her.

499
00:25:47,986 --> 00:25:49,696
Tita Barbs already told me about this.

500
00:25:50,984 --> 00:25:52,712
It’s only just sinking in that...

501
00:25:53,529 --> 00:25:56,454
Belle really hates them that much.

502
00:26:00,972 --> 00:26:01,899
Alright.

503
00:26:14,424 --> 00:26:16,892
You helped us with
the exhibit before, right?

504
00:26:17,622 --> 00:26:18,680
Now...

505
00:26:19,263 --> 00:26:21,220
I want to be the one to help you.

506
00:26:21,765 --> 00:26:23,423
Alright, but no taking it back, okay?

507
00:26:24,261 --> 00:26:25,888
Like this!

508
00:26:27,354 --> 00:26:28,251
Ysa...

509
00:26:29,356 --> 00:26:30,501
I really love you.

510
00:26:34,762 --> 00:26:35,805
I miss you, Ysa.

511
00:26:44,413 --> 00:26:46,923
You really won’t be able
to focus like that, Kuya.

512
00:26:47,666 --> 00:26:49,423
You know, you’re always
messing with me, huh?

513
00:26:49,893 --> 00:26:50,769
How am I messing with you?

514
00:26:50,942 --> 00:26:52,527
I'm just trying to help you.

515
00:26:53,024 --> 00:26:54,273
Whatever, bro.

516
00:26:54,428 --> 00:26:55,470
Leave me alone, bro.

517
00:26:55,495 --> 00:26:57,122
Just leave, I'm reviewing here.

518
00:26:59,831 --> 00:27:01,583
There’s already a way to...

519
00:27:01,982 --> 00:27:03,822
bring Ate Ysa out.

520
00:27:04,975 --> 00:27:05,838
But...

521
00:27:05,863 --> 00:27:07,948
it’s okay if you don’t want to know.

522
00:27:08,690 --> 00:27:09,954
I'll just leave.

523
00:27:11,023 --> 00:27:11,899
Hey, wait!

524
00:27:11,923 --> 00:27:14,050
Don't be so sensitive, bro.

525
00:27:14,604 --> 00:27:15,377
Nevermind.

526
00:27:15,402 --> 00:27:16,612
- Hey, come on. Hold on.
- Don't bother.

527
00:27:16,612 --> 00:27:17,915
Come on, what is it? What is it?

528
00:27:18,238 --> 00:27:19,007
I don't want to.

529
00:27:19,032 --> 00:27:19,866
Forget it.

530
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:22,409
Do you want me to clean your room?

531
00:27:22,659 --> 00:27:23,650
I'll take care of it.

532
00:27:23,994 --> 00:27:24,870
No, Kuya.

533
00:27:25,002 --> 00:27:26,634
It’s already clean. I don’t want to.

534
00:27:26,697 --> 00:27:28,624
Uh... food. Do you want
anything to eat, bro?

535
00:27:28,772 --> 00:27:30,690
Whatever it is, I'll buy it for you.

536
00:27:30,959 --> 00:27:32,419
I'm on a diet, Kuya.

537
00:27:32,419 --> 00:27:33,462
You're on a diet?

538
00:27:33,962 --> 00:27:34,980
Uh, hey.

539
00:27:35,005 --> 00:27:36,381
How about money, bro?

540
00:27:36,443 --> 00:27:37,447
I'll give you money.

541
00:27:37,925 --> 00:27:38,720
What?

542
00:27:38,842 --> 00:27:39,801
Just tell me, bro.

543
00:27:40,802 --> 00:27:41,695
How much?

544
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:42,613
Spill it to me first.

545
00:27:42,638 --> 00:27:43,655
How much will you give me?

546
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:45,098
Come on, just tell me first.

547
00:27:47,434 --> 00:27:48,361
Okay, okay.

548
00:27:49,937 --> 00:27:51,111
I thought...

549
00:27:51,688 --> 00:27:52,884
What if...

550
00:27:52,981 --> 00:27:55,567
you bring out all of her
other personalities first?

551
00:27:56,401 --> 00:27:57,252
Then,

552
00:27:57,277 --> 00:27:59,112
ask each of them

553
00:27:59,112 --> 00:28:00,923
to help you bring Ate Ysa out.

554
00:28:02,157 --> 00:28:03,408
I already thought of that, bro.

555
00:28:03,575 --> 00:28:04,868
Don't you have anything new?

556
00:28:05,911 --> 00:28:06,931
But...

557
00:28:07,371 --> 00:28:09,389
you have to make sure
Ate Belle doesn't notice.

558
00:28:09,554 --> 00:28:11,264
She’ll avoid you even
more if she finds out.

559
00:28:11,458 --> 00:28:13,001
It’ll only make things harder for you.

560
00:28:13,877 --> 00:28:15,170
Bro, I don't like Belle either.

561
00:28:15,286 --> 00:28:17,080
If it were up to me, I
would also avoid her.

562
00:28:17,711 --> 00:28:19,504
Kuya, there’s nothing you can do.

563
00:28:19,791 --> 00:28:21,084
It’s her body.

564
00:28:25,597 --> 00:28:26,932
You got any other ideas?

565
00:28:27,474 --> 00:28:28,375
What else did you come up with?

566
00:28:31,019 --> 00:28:32,172
Which...

567
00:28:32,525 --> 00:28:34,610
of her personalities...

568
00:28:35,064 --> 00:28:36,524
is the easiest

569
00:28:36,821 --> 00:28:37,864
to trigger?

570
00:28:42,948 --> 00:28:45,430
Balloon!

571
00:28:45,492 --> 00:28:47,077
Yeye wants the big one.

572
00:28:47,286 --> 00:28:49,413
- Big balloon please!
- Here's a big one.

573
00:28:51,999 --> 00:28:53,517
Play!

574
00:28:53,542 --> 00:28:55,043
Play! Play!

575
00:28:55,704 --> 00:28:57,080
Yeye, but...

576
00:28:57,504 --> 00:28:59,899
I don’t even know where Belle usually goes.

577
00:29:03,427 --> 00:29:04,636
Kuya, I know.

578
00:29:04,928 --> 00:29:06,179
Adel told me.

579
00:29:06,597 --> 00:29:07,389
So you knew all along.

580
00:29:07,389 --> 00:29:08,165
Where?

581
00:29:09,510 --> 00:29:10,468
How much?

582
00:29:15,897 --> 00:29:16,782
Here.

583
00:29:18,650 --> 00:29:19,579
Where?

584
00:29:21,695 --> 00:29:22,688
This isn't enough.

585
00:29:23,030 --> 00:29:24,573
No, wait. Here, here, here's another.

586
00:29:24,573 --> 00:29:26,251
- Stop pulling me.
- It's just money, okay?

587
00:29:26,276 --> 00:29:27,861
Here. That's all there is.

588
00:29:37,144 --> 00:29:40,272
Girl, if you want him to come back...

589
00:29:40,297 --> 00:29:42,841
show them that you’ve already moved on.

590
00:29:42,841 --> 00:29:43,859
How?

591
00:29:43,884 --> 00:29:45,635
Post something on social media.

592
00:29:45,635 --> 00:29:47,471
Pretend you’re with another guy.

593
00:29:47,471 --> 00:29:49,848
Let’s see if he doesn’t come back to you.

594
00:29:49,848 --> 00:29:51,266
Okay, I'll try.

595
00:29:51,266 --> 00:29:52,232
Alright.

596
00:29:53,018 --> 00:29:54,014
Bye!

597
00:30:00,525 --> 00:30:01,928
Balloons!

598
00:30:02,027 --> 00:30:03,945
Balloons for sale!

599
00:30:03,945 --> 00:30:07,157
For everybody, for
birthdays, for every kid, and...

600
00:30:07,157 --> 00:30:09,284
for those kids at heart!

601
00:30:09,284 --> 00:30:11,241
It's our cousin's birthday,
we want to buy one.

602
00:30:11,265 --> 00:30:12,537
Please, just one, mister.

603
00:30:12,537 --> 00:30:14,456
- I'm not selling these. Leave.
- We have money to buy.

604
00:30:14,456 --> 00:30:16,625
- Leave. These are not for sale, so leave.
- Mister, just one, please!

605
00:30:16,792 --> 00:30:17,918
So rude!

606
00:30:18,210 --> 00:30:19,753
Hello!

607
00:30:20,420 --> 00:30:21,838
You want balloons?

608
00:30:22,589 --> 00:30:23,757
Balloons!

609
00:30:26,389 --> 00:30:28,057
- What am I supposed to do with that?
- Balloons!

610
00:30:30,722 --> 00:30:33,975
Uh...the balloons are so pretty, look!

611
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:36,244
Beautiful balloons! Look how cute these
balloons are!

612
00:30:36,269 --> 00:30:37,896
Like you!

613
00:30:38,105 --> 00:30:39,081
Right?

614
00:30:39,106 --> 00:30:40,584
Are you trying to talk like a baby?

615
00:30:42,943 --> 00:30:44,403
Oh, wait. There’s one more. Just a second.

616
00:30:44,923 --> 00:30:47,050
You want some prizes?

617
00:30:47,826 --> 00:30:49,616
Look! Magic!

618
00:30:50,075 --> 00:30:51,256
Don’t you...

619
00:30:51,641 --> 00:30:53,810
don’t you love lollipops?

620
00:30:54,538 --> 00:30:56,475
Lollipops are delicious, right?

621
00:30:56,832 --> 00:30:57,920
Are you okay?

622
00:31:01,711 --> 00:31:02,754
Also, I know you.

623
00:31:06,215 --> 00:31:07,425
Are you following me?

624
00:31:10,637 --> 00:31:11,513
I'm not following you, okay?

625
00:31:13,140 --> 00:31:14,766
I just happened to be here too.

626
00:31:15,475 --> 00:31:17,018
Besides, I didn’t know

627
00:31:17,018 --> 00:31:18,395
you passed by here every day.

628
00:31:18,395 --> 00:31:19,416
How would I know?

629
00:31:20,063 --> 00:31:21,041
Oh, I see.

630
00:31:21,857 --> 00:31:23,208
Don't follow me.

631
00:31:23,233 --> 00:31:23,942
Oh, uh,

632
00:31:23,942 --> 00:31:25,152
you wanna play instead?

633
00:31:25,152 --> 00:31:26,111
You wanna play hopscotch?

634
00:31:26,111 --> 00:31:28,363
One, two, three!

635
00:31:28,505 --> 00:31:29,756
Or, uh, you want...

636
00:31:29,842 --> 00:31:31,882
Wanna be best friends?

637
00:31:31,908 --> 00:31:33,952
Pinky swear! Pinky swear! Pinky swear!

638
00:31:33,952 --> 00:31:35,026
What's your problem?

639
00:31:35,954 --> 00:31:36,872
I said,

640
00:31:36,872 --> 00:31:38,582
don't follow me!

641
00:31:49,009 --> 00:31:50,927
See mister, you got what
was coming to you!

642
00:31:50,952 --> 00:31:51,883
Come on, mister, let
us buy your balloons!

643
00:31:51,908 --> 00:31:52,856
We've been here for a while.

644
00:31:53,305 --> 00:31:54,389
- Please, mister.
- You got reject—

645
00:31:54,389 --> 00:31:55,891
Fine, fine. It’s your
cousin’s birthday, right?

646
00:31:55,891 --> 00:31:56,641
Happy birthday to your cousin.

647
00:31:56,641 --> 00:31:57,315
Here, take them.

648
00:31:57,392 --> 00:31:58,393
Just go. Go on.

649
00:31:58,393 --> 00:31:59,221
For free?

650
00:31:59,269 --> 00:32:00,301
Thank you!

651
00:32:07,104 --> 00:32:09,147
Are you sure they’ll pass by here, bro?

652
00:32:10,113 --> 00:32:11,168
Kuya...

653
00:32:11,448 --> 00:32:13,637
would Adel lie to me?

654
00:32:17,127 --> 00:32:18,179
Kuya, Kuya.

655
00:32:18,205 --> 00:32:18,955
They're here.

656
00:32:19,164 --> 00:32:20,624
What? Do you have a plan?

657
00:32:20,974 --> 00:32:21,850
Uh...

658
00:32:21,875 --> 00:32:23,168
I'll just pretend like I'm
shopping for clothes.

659
00:32:23,168 --> 00:32:24,085
I guess that'll do.

660
00:32:24,085 --> 00:32:25,670
Shop— Kuya, is there anything else?

661
00:32:25,670 --> 00:32:27,172
Something less predictable?

662
00:32:27,172 --> 00:32:29,049
There’s a plot twist, bro. Trust me, okay?

663
00:32:29,049 --> 00:32:30,457
I know what Cacai’s trigger is.

664
00:32:31,551 --> 00:32:32,512
Uh...

665
00:32:34,137 --> 00:32:35,661
Does this look good on me?

666
00:32:35,972 --> 00:32:36,348
Bro?

667
00:32:36,348 --> 00:32:37,365
See?

668
00:32:37,390 --> 00:32:38,308
Look at the blue!

669
00:32:38,308 --> 00:32:39,100
Mhm!

670
00:32:39,309 --> 00:32:41,887
Look, the royal blue
with the "bling bling", right?

671
00:32:41,912 --> 00:32:43,246
- Kuya.
- Why?

672
00:32:43,271 --> 00:32:45,440
You're a shitty actor.

673
00:32:45,708 --> 00:32:46,918
Just play along with me, okay?

674
00:32:48,735 --> 00:32:50,028
Right? See!

675
00:32:51,133 --> 00:32:52,551
- That one? Oh, Kuya.
- Yeah?

676
00:32:52,822 --> 00:32:53,865
It doesn't suit you.

677
00:32:53,865 --> 00:32:55,575
- Doesn't suit me? Tacky?
- It's tacky. Yes.

678
00:32:55,575 --> 00:32:56,451
Yeah. It looks bad.

679
00:32:56,451 --> 00:32:58,537
Oh, no!

680
00:32:59,538 --> 00:33:00,520
You know what.

681
00:33:00,731 --> 00:33:01,982
If only there was someone

682
00:33:02,082 --> 00:33:03,750
who’s, you know...girly.

683
00:33:04,584 --> 00:33:06,294
Someone who knows fashion.

684
00:33:06,628 --> 00:33:07,879
That would really help.

685
00:33:07,879 --> 00:33:09,673
Too bad!

686
00:33:09,673 --> 00:33:11,216
- What a shame.
- I know.

687
00:33:11,945 --> 00:33:12,631
Too bad.

688
00:33:12,656 --> 00:33:15,051
I really don’t believe this
is a coincidence anymore.

689
00:33:16,221 --> 00:33:17,097
Oh, you're here.

690
00:33:17,097 --> 00:33:18,622
Was she here this whole time?

691
00:33:18,807 --> 00:33:20,016
Uh...

692
00:33:20,016 --> 00:33:21,726
We didn’t ask for your help.

693
00:33:22,394 --> 00:33:23,223
Right?

694
00:33:23,313 --> 00:33:24,898
Oh, is that so?

695
00:33:25,272 --> 00:33:25,814
Mhm!

696
00:33:25,814 --> 00:33:28,400
Too bad. I might’ve had an idea.

697
00:33:28,525 --> 00:33:30,309
I was actually going to help you.

698
00:33:33,280 --> 00:33:33,989
Aha!

699
00:33:34,197 --> 00:33:35,740
- Kuya, Kuya, wait a minute.
- Yeah?

700
00:33:35,740 --> 00:33:36,616
I just need to go there.

701
00:33:36,616 --> 00:33:37,742
- Where?
- Just over there!

702
00:33:37,742 --> 00:33:38,872
I saw someone beautiful.

703
00:33:39,619 --> 00:33:40,161
Oh!

704
00:33:40,328 --> 00:33:41,621
It's actually Adel!

705
00:33:42,205 --> 00:33:43,270
Just a minute, Kuya.

706
00:33:47,887 --> 00:33:49,097
Do you have...

707
00:33:50,463 --> 00:33:51,881
any fashion tips for me?

708
00:33:52,674 --> 00:33:53,504
Right?

709
00:33:53,842 --> 00:33:55,760
Maybe something in...

710
00:33:56,386 --> 00:33:57,445
brown?

711
00:33:57,470 --> 00:34:00,557
Or maybe earthy tones, like...

712
00:34:01,683 --> 00:34:02,848
navy brown?

713
00:34:02,976 --> 00:34:05,937
That could work, or maybe something like...

714
00:34:06,313 --> 00:34:07,473
neon black?

715
00:34:08,690 --> 00:34:09,899
There, there, there. Get in there.

716
00:34:14,520 --> 00:34:15,855
What is your Kuya doing?

717
00:34:16,903 --> 00:34:19,197
He's just following his heart.

718
00:34:21,155 --> 00:34:22,365
He's so cheesy.

719
00:34:22,537 --> 00:34:23,496
Wasn't he already told he co—

720
00:34:23,496 --> 00:34:24,581
He can.

721
00:34:26,502 --> 00:34:28,212
Don't be so uptight, babe.

722
00:34:29,461 --> 00:34:30,684
'Babe' your face!

723
00:34:35,091 --> 00:34:35,965
Whoo!

724
00:34:43,429 --> 00:34:44,847
What a dork.

725
00:34:48,563 --> 00:34:49,314
I think...

726
00:34:49,368 --> 00:34:50,442
I look like an idiot in this.

727
00:34:53,085 --> 00:34:54,336
Exactly.

728
00:34:57,597 --> 00:34:58,639
Ate Belle, wait!

729
00:34:59,799 --> 00:35:00,842
Kuya, Kuya.

730
00:35:00,867 --> 00:35:01,968
You're right.

731
00:35:02,102 --> 00:35:03,137
You look like an iditot.

732
00:35:03,745 --> 00:35:04,637
So, Kuya...

733
00:35:05,282 --> 00:35:07,993
did you bring out Cacai? Huh?

734
00:35:08,875 --> 00:35:09,731
There.

735
00:35:10,001 --> 00:35:10,950
She's out.

736
00:35:12,003 --> 00:35:12,965
Oh...

737
00:35:13,662 --> 00:35:14,981
That was the plot twist.

738
00:35:19,219 --> 00:35:20,095
Satisfied?

739
00:35:24,683 --> 00:35:26,810
This one's for Aling Loring.

740
00:35:26,810 --> 00:35:27,519
Yes.

741
00:35:27,519 --> 00:35:28,520
Weigh it in.

742
00:35:29,460 --> 00:35:31,504
- Did you weigh it properly?
- Yes.

743
00:35:32,482 --> 00:35:33,441
How much was it?

744
00:35:33,441 --> 00:35:34,567
I think it was a kilo and a half.

745
00:35:34,567 --> 00:35:35,481
That's already enough.

746
00:35:37,827 --> 00:35:39,286
Who the heck is this Estong?!

747
00:35:39,311 --> 00:35:40,965
Why is he always following me?!

748
00:35:40,990 --> 00:35:41,991
How close is he to Ysa?

749
00:35:41,991 --> 00:35:43,676
And to my other personalities?!

750
00:35:44,077 --> 00:35:46,751
How long was I actually
gone? How many days?!

751
00:35:46,776 --> 00:35:48,444
What are you not telling me?!

752
00:35:48,832 --> 00:35:49,708
Uh, sweetheart...

753
00:35:49,895 --> 00:35:51,415
not just days,

754
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:52,817
but almost a month.

755
00:35:54,198 --> 00:35:55,128
What?

756
00:35:56,673 --> 00:35:58,723
A lot has happened while you were gone.

757
00:36:03,061 --> 00:36:04,271
You finished

758
00:36:04,556 --> 00:36:05,801
your painting.

759
00:36:05,942 --> 00:36:07,458
You were included in the exhibit.

760
00:36:07,809 --> 00:36:08,935
You were able to finish all of that

761
00:36:08,935 --> 00:36:11,062
because of your personalities and Estong.

762
00:36:13,029 --> 00:36:13,941
No.

763
00:36:14,430 --> 00:36:16,599
That wasn’t me. I didn’t do any of that.

764
00:36:16,693 --> 00:36:17,652
I didn’t do that.

765
00:36:17,652 --> 00:36:19,112
Why did they even do that?

766
00:36:20,321 --> 00:36:21,297
Uh, sweetheart.

767
00:36:21,322 --> 00:36:24,367
Please don’t be mad at us for not telling
you right away, okay?

768
00:36:24,367 --> 00:36:27,098
And also to your other
personalities like Ysa.

769
00:36:27,713 --> 00:36:29,981
She just wanted to help.

770
00:36:33,008 --> 00:36:34,551
I don't need help.

771
00:36:35,044 --> 00:36:37,130
I don’t need anyone’s help,

772
00:36:37,130 --> 00:36:39,887
especially not Estong’s!

773
00:36:45,430 --> 00:36:46,723
I hope...

774
00:36:46,723 --> 00:36:48,475
more people will get
to see your paintings.

775
00:36:49,100 --> 00:36:50,309
And I hope...

776
00:36:50,769 --> 00:36:52,437
your dream of having
an exhibit comes true.

777
00:36:53,104 --> 00:36:54,397
Just make sure you'll come, okay?

778
00:36:54,397 --> 00:36:55,273
Of course.

779
00:36:55,940 --> 00:36:56,982
That's a promise.

780
00:36:57,776 --> 00:37:00,612
If you want the man who left you
to come back...

781
00:37:00,612 --> 00:37:03,131
show them that you’ve already moved on.

782
00:37:03,156 --> 00:37:04,996
Post something on social media

783
00:37:05,021 --> 00:37:06,743
and pretend you’re with another guy.

784
00:37:06,743 --> 00:37:09,193
Let’s see if he doesn’t come back to you.

785
00:37:12,967 --> 00:37:14,427
So that’s what you want, huh?

786
00:37:14,619 --> 00:37:16,458
You just won’t stop. Fine...

787
00:37:16,669 --> 00:37:18,171
I’ll give you exactly what you want.

788
00:37:36,064 --> 00:37:37,123
Hey, Estong.

789
00:37:37,148 --> 00:37:38,456
Can you get the—

790
00:37:40,443 --> 00:37:41,526
Hello!

791
00:37:41,653 --> 00:37:43,029
Oh, Pops! Pops.

792
00:37:43,250 --> 00:37:44,128
What's the problem?

793
00:37:46,074 --> 00:37:47,258
Uh, this week...

794
00:37:47,430 --> 00:37:49,557
I was told to go to the
embassy, Pops, for my visa.

795
00:37:49,953 --> 00:37:51,412
They said they need some clarification

796
00:37:51,412 --> 00:37:52,542
on my requirements.

797
00:37:53,414 --> 00:37:55,583
Then don't be nervous.

798
00:37:57,752 --> 00:37:58,728
Not at all, Pops.

799
00:37:58,753 --> 00:38:00,203
It's not like

800
00:38:00,228 --> 00:38:01,270
a licensure exam.

801
00:38:01,770 --> 00:38:03,605
And I'm sure I'll pass as long as...

802
00:38:04,158 --> 00:38:06,160
it's surely legal and not a scam.

803
00:38:06,511 --> 00:38:07,362
Hopefully.

804
00:38:07,387 --> 00:38:08,268
Good.

805
00:38:09,305 --> 00:38:10,723
So, is this...

806
00:38:11,135 --> 00:38:12,141
a sure thing?

807
00:38:12,141 --> 00:38:14,269
Nothing can stop you now?

808
00:38:18,788 --> 00:38:20,623
That’s the thing, Pops.
I’ve been thinking about it too.

809
00:38:23,871 --> 00:38:25,998
Uh... it’s just that...

810
00:38:27,073 --> 00:38:28,616
the closer I get to her...

811
00:38:29,075 --> 00:38:30,323
it seems like...

812
00:38:30,625 --> 00:38:32,245
the farther she keeps pulling away from me.

813
00:38:34,081 --> 00:38:36,262
Don’t worry about it. Just...

814
00:38:36,287 --> 00:38:38,205
you know, if she’s meant for you...

815
00:38:39,066 --> 00:38:40,484
she’ll come to you.

816
00:38:42,964 --> 00:38:44,057
Kuya.

817
00:38:45,717 --> 00:38:46,924
it's Ate Belle.

818
00:38:48,114 --> 00:38:49,908
See? That was fast!

819
00:38:55,184 --> 00:38:56,268
Well, go on.

820
00:38:56,352 --> 00:38:57,203
Pops.

821
00:38:57,228 --> 00:38:58,463
Just go.

822
00:39:00,273 --> 00:39:01,549
- Yeah?
- Estong.

823
00:39:02,692 --> 00:39:03,643
Belle.

824
00:39:04,193 --> 00:39:05,971
