828
00:39:16,152 --> 00:39:17,570
They’ve already told me everything.

829
00:39:18,541 --> 00:39:19,542
Thank you.

830
00:39:19,959 --> 00:39:21,018
Really?

831
00:39:21,741 --> 00:39:22,617
Uh...

832
00:39:22,795 --> 00:39:24,542
It was nothing. Don't mention it.

833
00:39:24,714 --> 00:39:25,940
Plus,

834
00:39:26,007 --> 00:39:27,432
