835
00:39:31,137 --> 00:39:32,432
Can I order?

836
00:39:32,887 --> 00:39:33,596
Uh...

837
00:39:33,621 --> 00:39:34,497
Are you open?

838
00:39:35,408 --> 00:39:36,618
Pops, we're already open, right?

839
00:39:36,643 --> 00:39:38,065
Yeah, we've been open
since yesterday, actually.

840
00:39:38,089 --> 00:39:39,370
Yes, Kuya. We're already open.

841
00:39:39,395 --> 00:39:40,284
What do you want?

842
00:39:40,855 --> 00:39:42,002
What do you recommend?

843
00:39:42,148 --> 00:39:43,479
Oh, our recommendation?

844
00:39:43,899 --> 00:39:45,108
Uh, this one.

845
00:39:46,778 --> 00:39:47,921
Americano.

846
00:39:48,195 --> 00:39:49,821
- We have Iced Latte,
- Wait, hold on.

847
00:39:49,989 --> 00:39:52,102
Why does it feel like
the tide suddenly turned?

848
00:39:52,126 --> 00:39:53,245
or just Latte.

849
00:39:54,160 --> 00:39:55,453
Just let it go, Pops.

850
00:39:55,787 --> 00:39:56,846
What matters is...

851
