they seem to be okay now.

852
00:39:59,508 --> 00:40:00,424
Fair enough.

853
00:40:01,167 --> 00:40:02,018
So, yeah.

854
00:40:02,043 --> 00:40:04,799
If you’re hungry, we’ve got pizza too.

855
00:40:05,338 --> 00:40:07,256
If you want...

856
00:40:07,882 --> 00:40:10,009
well, we also have
refreshments, Iced Lemon Tea.

857
00:40:10,009 --> 00:40:11,159
That’s good, too.

858
00:40:25,900 --> 00:40:26,954
There.

859
00:40:26,985 --> 00:40:27,907
It's finished.

860
00:40:30,196 --> 00:40:31,438
Here's your coffee.

861
00:40:34,784 --> 00:40:35,969
- Thank you.
- I'll just put it here.

862
00:40:39,080 --> 00:40:40,243
Can you take a picture of me?

863
00:40:43,792 --> 00:40:45,001
Oh. Okay, okay.

864
00:40:45,128 --> 00:40:46,219
- Right here.
- Where?

865
00:40:46,921 --> 00:40:47,813
Okay.

866
00:40:50,757 --> 00:40:52,342
One, two, three...Smile!

867
00:40:53,622 --> 00:40:55,423
I don't smile for pictures.

868
00:40:56,849 --> 00:40:58,101
Oh, okay. Alright.

869
00:41:03,088 --> 00:41:04,714
- There.
- All good? Let me see.

870
00:41:04,930 --> 00:41:06,001
All good.

871
