Estong, let's take a selfie.

872
00:41:13,614 --> 00:41:14,758
With me?

873
00:41:16,034 --> 00:41:17,093
Yeah.

874
00:41:17,118 --> 00:41:18,071
Don't you want to?

875
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:20,032
