876
00:41:20,413 --> 00:41:21,622
Uh...sure, okay.

877
00:41:21,622 --> 00:41:23,041
- Come. Come here.
- I'm game.

878
00:41:25,918 --> 00:41:27,462
Uh, wait. Hold on, I'll just...

879
00:41:30,366 --> 00:41:31,242
Okay, let's do it.

880
00:41:31,267 --> 00:41:32,079
Here.

881
00:41:34,293 --> 00:41:35,502
