882
00:41:37,930 --> 00:41:38,977
One more.

883
00:41:44,199 --> 00:41:45,157
I'll post it.

884
00:41:46,230 --> 00:41:48,858
My artwork with Estong. Smiley face.

885
00:41:48,858 --> 00:41:50,220
Why would she post it?

886
00:41:53,164 --> 00:41:54,314
Did you say something?

887
00:41:54,864 --> 00:41:56,074
Uh...nothing, nothing.

888
00:41:56,365 --> 00:41:57,142
Oh.

889
00:41:57,788 --> 00:41:58,814
Add me, okay?

890
