Oh, sure, sure.

891
00:42:01,245 --> 00:42:02,955
Just accept my request, okay?

892
00:42:33,986 --> 00:42:34,897
Loves?

893
00:42:35,305 --> 00:42:36,473
- Yes?
- Loves, look at this.

894
00:42:38,116 --> 00:42:40,076
Looks like Belle’s been

895
