896
00:42:42,351 --> 00:42:43,576
You know what...

897
00:42:44,392 --> 00:42:46,019
I really gotta hand it to Estong.

898
00:42:46,666 --> 00:42:49,085
He really won't give up on her, huh?

899
00:42:50,753 --> 00:42:51,889
He's something else.

900
00:43:00,522 --> 00:43:02,828
I was able to answer
everything, Momsy Tita.

901
00:43:03,439 --> 00:43:06,442
They said I'll just have to wait for
the email with my visa grant letter.

902
00:43:07,103 --> 00:43:08,586
But sure, I’ll let you know

903
00:43:08,611 --> 00:43:09,961
as soon as there’s any news.

904
00:43:10,718 --> 00:43:11,758
Estong!

905
00:43:13,109 --> 00:43:13,953
Belle.

906
00:43:16,028 --> 00:43:17,039
Well, well.

907
00:43:18,233 --> 00:43:19,859
You're all dressed up today.

908
00:43:21,951 --> 00:43:22,885
Why?

909
00:43:23,018 --> 00:43:24,311
Do I always look haggard?

910
00:43:25,705 --> 00:43:26,781
Ah, hang on.

911
00:43:27,320 --> 00:43:28,524
I’m gonna post you on my story.

912
00:43:28,916 --> 00:43:29,333
Huh?

913
00:43:29,395 --> 00:43:30,647
Why? Oh—

914
00:43:30,960 --> 00:43:32,837
Wow! Look at you!

915
00:43:33,296 --> 00:43:35,173
All dressed up! The outfit...

916
00:43:35,173 --> 00:43:37,466
the shoes, the hair.

917
00:43:37,967 --> 00:43:40,375
Uh, okay. That's enough. I'm embarrassed.

918
00:43:41,721 --> 00:43:42,609
I'll post it.

919
00:43:43,431 --> 00:43:44,516
You're so handsome.

920
00:43:44,891 --> 00:43:45,933
Why are you posting it?

921
