Why not?

922
00:43:49,245 --> 00:43:50,734
You gave me your consent.

923
00:43:52,857 --> 00:43:54,063
Did I?

924
00:43:54,525 --> 00:43:55,836
I don’t think I did.

925
00:43:56,986 --> 00:43:58,171
Oh, so you don't want to?

926
00:43:58,196 --> 00:44:00,281
- Okay, delete it then.
- Oh, no. It's okay, it's fine.

927
00:44:00,281 --> 00:44:02,047
- No, you can delete it.
- Don't. It's okay, just post it.

928
00:44:02,840 --> 00:44:03,883
- All good?
- Yeah.

929
00:44:04,619 --> 00:44:05,494
I’ll go ahead, okay?

930
00:44:05,494 --> 00:44:06,954
Thanks! I still have to
take care of something.

931
00:44:06,954 --> 00:44:07,896
Bye!

932
00:44:12,835 --> 00:44:14,068
What was that?

933
00:44:22,247 --> 00:44:24,249
I hope her five followers like my outfit.

934
00:44:33,147 --> 00:44:34,290
You know...

935
00:44:34,315 --> 00:44:36,342
I really thought you weren’t going to talk
to me anymore.

936
00:44:36,979 --> 00:44:38,256
Because you're Belle.

937
00:44:39,374 --> 00:44:40,917
You're really different from...

938
00:44:43,199 --> 00:44:44,092
Belle?

939
00:44:45,076 --> 00:44:46,951
I'm different because...

940
00:44:47,620 --> 00:44:49,045
because of my condition?

941
00:44:50,012 --> 00:44:51,305
Hey, I didn't say that.

942
00:44:51,655 --> 00:44:52,959
What I was going to say was...

943
00:44:53,459 --> 00:44:55,178
you're really different
from your personalities.

944
00:44:55,628 --> 00:44:56,796
Especially from Ysa.

945
00:44:56,952 --> 00:44:58,203
Estong, can you not?

946
00:44:58,750 --> 00:45:00,752
Don’t mention them to me.

947
00:45:01,294 --> 00:45:02,837
I'm me. Just me.

948
00:45:04,845 --> 00:45:05,842
Okay.

949
00:45:11,894 --> 00:45:13,813
You’ve been typing on that for a while now.

950
00:45:13,813 --> 00:45:14,740
Who are you talking to?

951
00:45:15,731 --> 00:45:17,108
Huh? Oh. No one,

952
00:45:17,178 --> 00:45:18,287
just a friend.

953
00:45:18,943 --> 00:45:19,986
A friend.

954
00:45:20,152 --> 00:45:21,217
Do I know him?

955
00:45:21,821 --> 00:45:22,850
Secret.

956
00:45:26,158 --> 00:45:26,964
Ah!

957
00:45:26,989 --> 00:45:28,449
Let's take a picture.
I'll send it to my friend.

958
00:45:30,538 --> 00:45:31,514
Smile.

959
00:45:31,539 --> 00:45:33,326
I thought you don't smile.

960
00:45:33,377 --> 00:45:34,982
Come on, one more. Closer.

961
00:45:35,480 --> 00:45:37,190
Smile!

962
00:45:39,380 --> 00:45:40,287
Okay.

963
00:45:41,222 --> 00:45:42,348
Come on, who is it?

964
00:45:43,613 --> 00:45:45,073
It's nobody.

965
00:45:46,304 --> 00:45:47,321
Alright.

966
00:45:47,346 --> 00:45:48,764
I’ll let you have your way.

967
00:45:49,463 --> 00:45:50,943
Just do the same for me.

968
00:45:51,684 --> 00:45:52,584
With what?

969
00:45:54,501 --> 00:45:55,584
A date.

970
00:45:56,647 --> 00:45:57,415
A date?

971
00:45:57,440 --> 00:45:58,833
What are you talking about?

972
00:45:59,100 --> 00:46:00,268
Just a friendly date.

973
00:46:01,677 --> 00:46:02,719
As friends.

974
00:46:03,808 --> 00:46:04,952
You're so random.

975
00:46:06,315 --> 00:46:07,550
Why?

976
00:46:07,575 --> 00:46:09,467
What’s the problem? We’re friends.

977
00:46:12,955 --> 00:46:14,056
Tita, Tito...

978
00:46:14,197 --> 00:46:16,693
I was just...I just brought Belle home.

979
00:46:17,168 --> 00:46:18,836
We can see that.

980
00:46:21,589 --> 00:46:23,341
- Ah, Estong...
- Yes?

981
00:46:23,608 --> 00:46:24,483
Um...

982
00:46:24,508 --> 00:46:26,510
Just text me the details

983
00:46:26,510 --> 00:46:27,970
of our friendly date, okay?

984
00:46:29,180 --> 00:46:29,889
Really?

985
00:46:29,889 --> 00:46:30,740
Mhm!

986
00:46:30,765 --> 00:46:33,517
Okay, I’ll just text you the time,

987
00:46:33,517 --> 00:46:34,910
the date...

988
00:46:34,935 --> 00:46:35,911
and the place.

989
00:46:35,936 --> 00:46:36,602
Bye!

990
00:46:36,687 --> 00:46:37,980
- Nang, Nong, I'll head inside.
- Okay.

991
00:46:37,980 --> 00:46:39,165
- Alright.
- Good night, dear.

992
00:46:39,252 --> 00:46:40,711
Good night! Good night, Belle!

993
00:46:42,127 --> 00:46:43,023
Good night!

994
00:46:45,154 --> 00:46:45,863
Estong.

995
00:46:47,365 --> 00:46:48,784
You really didn't stop, huh?

996
00:46:50,701 --> 00:46:51,285
Tita...

997
00:46:51,285 --> 00:46:53,245
What I mean is...

998
00:46:53,496 --> 00:46:54,538
thank you

999
00:46:54,654 --> 00:46:56,690
for never giving up.

1000
00:46:57,166 --> 00:46:59,752
Thank you for staying by Belle's side,

1001
00:46:59,960 --> 00:47:01,754
even after you learned the truth.

1002
00:47:01,962 --> 00:47:04,840
For being there for her and being such a
good friend to her.

1003
00:47:07,551 --> 00:47:08,761
I accept Belle.

1004
00:47:09,929 --> 00:47:11,305
Whoever she is...

1005
00:47:11,764 --> 00:47:12,473
and whoever they are.

1006
00:47:13,391 --> 00:47:14,600
Isn't that a song?

1007
00:47:17,436 --> 00:47:19,063
Alright, alright. You can go home now.

1008
00:47:19,063 --> 00:47:20,147
Take care.

1009
00:47:20,147 --> 00:47:20,689
Okay.

1010
00:47:20,714 --> 00:47:21,932
Alright, go ahead, go home now.

1011
00:47:21,957 --> 00:47:24,171
- Good night!
- Okay, good night! Good night.

1012
00:47:24,652 --> 00:47:25,836
Good night!

1013
00:47:25,861 --> 00:47:26,882
Take care!

1014
00:47:27,530 --> 00:47:28,585
Good night!

1015
00:47:33,202 --> 00:47:34,078
Whoo!

1016
00:47:47,842 --> 00:47:48,765
Pops.

1017
00:47:51,178 --> 00:47:52,071
Wow.

1018
00:47:52,096 --> 00:47:53,697
- Right?
- Looking good.

1019
00:47:53,830 --> 00:47:55,156
Looks just like me, right?

1020
00:47:55,766 --> 00:47:57,810
My Kuya is so handsome.

1021
00:47:57,810 --> 00:47:59,320
He definitely got it from me.

1022
00:47:59,645 --> 00:48:01,421
- There’s just one thing missing, bro.
- What?

1023
00:48:02,626 --> 00:48:04,127
- Oops!
- There you go.

1024
00:48:09,921 --> 00:48:11,006
Wow!

1025
00:48:11,031 --> 00:48:13,284
- Strato smells even better.
- Right?

1026
00:48:13,576 --> 00:48:16,203
Even if you don’t shower for a whole
week, Kuya...

1027
00:48:16,203 --> 00:48:17,663
- You're right about that.
- you'll still smell good. Right?

1028
00:48:17,811 --> 00:48:19,140
You're right about that, bro.

1029
00:48:19,165 --> 00:48:21,125
- I know!
- I like it!

1030
00:48:21,459 --> 00:48:22,918
- You like it, bro?
- Yes!

1031
00:48:25,129 --> 00:48:26,303
Pops, what's wrong?

1032
00:48:26,338 --> 00:48:27,798
Is there a problem, Pops?

1033
00:48:27,798 --> 00:48:28,842
Um...

1034
00:48:29,275 --> 00:48:30,317
No, nothing.

1035
00:48:31,051 --> 00:48:31,594
Son,

1036
00:48:31,736 --> 00:48:33,195
don’t you find it strange

1037
00:48:33,220 --> 00:48:34,615
that Belle suddenly...

1038
00:48:34,640 --> 00:48:36,141
became nicer?

1039
00:48:39,185 --> 00:48:40,561
Is there something you want to say, Pops?

1040
00:48:40,561 --> 00:48:41,604
Yeah, Pops. What is it?

1041
00:48:41,604 --> 00:48:43,022
No. No, it's nothing. It's just that...

1042
00:48:43,772 --> 00:48:45,733
I don't know. I just have this feeling.

1043
00:48:46,442 --> 00:48:47,485
But...

1044
00:48:47,943 --> 00:48:49,320
Oh, don't worry about it.

1045
00:48:49,320 --> 00:48:49,945
Maybe I'm...

1046
00:48:50,946 --> 00:48:52,490
just excited for you.

1047
00:48:53,782 --> 00:48:54,825
Oh, Pops.

1048
00:48:54,992 --> 00:48:56,243
You're always nervous.

1049
00:48:56,494 --> 00:48:57,344
Pops...

1050
00:48:57,369 --> 00:48:58,579
it's just a friendly date, okay?

1051
00:48:58,579 --> 00:49:00,226
Kuya's not getting married yet.

1052
00:49:00,251 --> 00:49:01,137
Okay?

1053
00:49:01,999 --> 00:49:04,126
He might trigger her again...

1054
00:49:04,126 --> 00:49:06,746
and who knows which
identity will come out this time.

1055
00:49:10,174 --> 00:49:11,363
He's right, Kuya.

1056
00:49:11,611 --> 00:49:12,676
Just chill, okay?

1057
00:49:15,554 --> 00:49:16,805
You guys should be the one to chill.

1058
00:49:16,805 --> 00:49:19,308
Maybe you’re just overthinking it, Pops.

1059
00:49:19,308 --> 00:49:21,018
There's really no problem.

1060
00:49:21,018 --> 00:49:22,786
- Nothing is going to happen.
- Sorry, sorry.

1061
00:49:22,811 --> 00:49:23,854
- Just chill, Pops, okay?
- Yeah, I know.

1062
00:49:23,854 --> 00:49:24,871
Alright then.

1063
00:49:25,120 --> 00:49:26,705
I’ll go ahead. I might be late.

1064
00:49:26,732 --> 00:49:27,675
Okay, Kuya.

1065
00:49:27,700 --> 00:49:28,242
Popsy.

1066
00:49:28,267 --> 00:49:29,143
Pick her up, okay?

1067
00:49:29,168 --> 00:49:30,211
No. We’re meeting there.

1068
00:49:30,236 --> 00:49:30,945
Oh, there?

1069
00:49:30,945 --> 00:49:31,946
- Okay, okay.
- You can have this.

1070
00:49:31,946 --> 00:49:32,738
Popsy.

1071
00:49:32,738 --> 00:49:33,961
- Take care.
- Bye! Bye!

1072
00:49:33,986 --> 00:49:35,277
- Take care. Be safe.
- Alright, Kuya!

1073
00:49:38,198 --> 00:49:39,144
Hey.

1074
00:49:40,352 --> 00:49:41,395
Mhm.

1075
00:49:42,873 --> 00:49:44,083
Don't. Even.

1076
00:49:45,584 --> 00:49:46,293
Oi.

1077
00:49:47,002 --> 00:49:48,771
- Hey, Pops, look at that.
- Shhh.

1078
00:49:48,796 --> 00:49:49,777
Hey!

1079
00:49:51,006 --> 00:49:52,004
Knock it off.

1080
00:49:53,801 --> 00:49:55,113
You really want it? Here.

1081
00:49:57,564 --> 00:49:59,107
Smells good. What's it called, Pops?

1082
00:49:59,515 --> 00:50:00,496
"Strato."

1083
00:50:01,058 --> 00:50:01,909
Body spray.

1084
00:50:01,934 --> 00:50:02,726
It suits you.

1085
00:50:03,820 --> 00:50:04,863
'Cause you're an idiot.

1086
00:50:18,325 --> 00:50:19,201
Hi, sir. Excuse me.

1087
00:50:19,493 --> 00:50:20,703
Are you ready for your order?

1088
00:50:22,204 --> 00:50:23,581
I'm still waiting for someone, so...

1089
00:50:24,206 --> 00:50:25,374
water's fine for now.

1090
00:50:25,374 --> 00:50:26,458
- Okay, thank you.
- Thank you!

1091
00:50:35,467 --> 00:50:36,427
- Let's go.
- Mhm.

1092
00:50:36,760 --> 00:50:37,553
Thank you.

1093
00:50:42,474 --> 00:50:43,747
- Let's go.
- Come on.

1094
00:50:43,772 --> 00:50:45,231
I missed this place.

1095
00:50:45,311 --> 00:50:47,646
The food is great here!
Glad we came back.

1096
00:50:47,646 --> 00:50:49,023
- Yeah, exactly.
- Belle?

1097
00:50:50,865 --> 00:50:51,866
Estong!

1098
00:50:53,919 --> 00:50:55,232
What are you doing here?

1099
00:51:08,917 --> 00:51:10,210
Lorenz, this is Estong.

1100
00:51:12,338 --> 00:51:13,397
I know you, bro.

1101
00:51:13,492 --> 00:51:14,660
I know you too, bro.

1102
00:51:15,006 --> 00:51:16,507
I'm Lorenz, by the way.

1103
00:51:17,051 --> 00:51:20,613
Nang, what matters is
that Lorenz is back,

1104
00:51:20,638 --> 00:51:22,973
he’s here, and we’re okay now.

1105
00:51:23,182 --> 00:51:24,600
That's why, I’m glad…

1106
00:51:25,100 --> 00:51:28,520
because you’re embracing
everything you’re feeling right now.

1107
00:51:28,896 --> 00:51:34,652
You're accepting everything
that brings you both pain and happiness,

1108
00:51:34,652 --> 00:51:36,111
especially in love.

1109
00:51:36,403 --> 00:51:37,537
Belle, are you okay?

1110
00:51:38,113 --> 00:51:39,443
I'll call for help.

1111
00:51:39,708 --> 00:51:41,209
No need, Estong. I'm okay.

1112
00:51:41,450 --> 00:51:42,224
Ysa?

1113
00:51:42,249 --> 00:51:44,011
You're sure of what you heard...

1114
00:51:44,036 --> 00:51:46,497
so why don't you
tell Ate Belle already?

1115
00:51:46,497 --> 00:51:47,498
I can't bro.

1116
00:51:47,498 --> 00:51:50,042
She’ll get hurt. She might
hurt herself again,

1117
00:51:50,042 --> 00:51:51,043
and that’s not all…

1118
00:51:51,043 --> 00:51:52,978
Ysa might not be the only
one who’ll come out.

1119
00:51:53,135 --> 00:51:54,345
Then, that's what you need to tell her.

1120
00:51:54,880 --> 00:51:56,170
What, Pops?

1121
00:51:56,298 --> 00:51:57,841
Be straight with Belle.

1122
00:51:57,841 --> 00:52:03,232
Tell her you’re jealous and you’re
worried she’ll just end up with Lorenz.

1123
00:52:05,557 --> 00:52:07,310
I'm here to court you, Belle!
